WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.040
As everybody knows, Santa Claus lives in the
North Pole.

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:06.550
More specifically, in the Svalbard archipielago,
where there

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:18.789
is the northernmost human settlement. Svalbard
is the only

00:00:18.789 --> 00:00:22.259
place on Earth where you don´t need a visa
to enter.

00:00:22.259 --> 00:00:26.470
However, their 2600 habitants must be self-sufficient
and

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:33.590
carry a gun anytime they leave the main town.
This is

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.640
because of the polar bears population, who
might tear your

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:39.390
body apart with no mercy if they find you
unarmed. But,

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.830
over all, Svalbard, which belongs to the Kingdom
of

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:45.300
Norway, is the hotspot of a political dispute
with Russia.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.690
Yes, this frozen paradise has pretty good
chances to

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:56.710
become the new Dubai. They have one of the
bigges oil

00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:59.470
beds in the world. And even more! They are
the Gateway to

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:01.720
the Artic route, a new commercial route that
might become

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:05.220
one of the most important ways for the international
trade.

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:16.929
This is why Svalbard is more than another
territorial dispute.

00:01:16.929 --> 00:01:20.700
We are talking about a new cold war involving
the United

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:29.950
States, Canada and even China. Today, we will
tell you the

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:36.179
story.
Imagine a land with open doors for immigrants,

00:01:36.179 --> 00:01:37.179
no matter

00:01:37.179 --> 00:01:39.090
where do they come from. A place where military
presence

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:42.929
is forbidden because it´s a demilitarized
zone. A fiscal

00:01:42.929 --> 00:01:47.929
haven with the average salary of Norway. Well…
this place

00:01:47.929 --> 00:01:50.960
exists and it´s called SVALBARD. And yes,
it is in the North

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:54.590
Pole. If you go to Svalbard, there is no need
to worry about

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:57.259
catching a cold or a flu: the extremely cold
temperatures

00:01:57.259 --> 00:02:01.490
make it impossible for virus and bacterias
to stay here.

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:04.240
And, by the way, in their capital, LONGYEARBYEN,
is

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:06.459
where you can find the world´s biggest liquor
collection.

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:08.709
Just like that. If you wanna try a cognac
from the 19 th

00:02:08.709 --> 00:02:12.209
century or a rare and exclusive whisky, Karlsberger
Pub is

00:02:12.209 --> 00:02:15.650
the place to go. Let me introduce you to their
owner, Steve

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:39.709
Dorfssen.
At 

00:02:39.709 --> 00:02:48.280
the beginning of the XX Century, Svalbard
was a no

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:52.760
man´s land and only some whale fishermen
would dare to

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.780
go through the place. Nonetheless, after the
First World

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:58.650
War, almost all the countries signed the Svalbard
Treaty.

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:02.040
There it´s written that Norway holds the
sovereignity over

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.769
the territory… But with some restrictions!
Basically,

00:03:04.769 --> 00:03:07.480
Norwegian government is banned to put any
ban. They

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:08.910
can´t send their army, nor build any headquarter
or

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:12.769
stronghold. And they must allow every citizen
or company,

00:03:12.769 --> 00:03:15.640
no matter where are they from, to enter the
islands and

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:20.560
exploit their natural resources. And this
is how two cities

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:21.560
where born.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.540
On one hand we have LONGYEARBYEN, where the

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:27.060
majority of the population is Norwegian. On
the other hand

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:30.020
there is BARENTSBURG, with a Russian majority.
In both

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:45.450
cases, they started as coal-miners settlements.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:47.760
And now you might wonder Where do the mining

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.030
companies pay their taxes in Svalbard? Well…
despite

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:52.910
being a Norwegian territory, the Svalbard
treaty forbids to

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:56.310
any country to tax the profits. This means,
their citizens pay

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:59.770
the minimum required to finance their own
governance. In

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:02.420
other words: Svalbard could be considered
as a fiscal

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:05.609
haven. They have no VAT and their corporate
tax raises to

00:04:05.609 --> 00:04:26.760
a 16%, which is even lower than Singapore´s.
But make no mistake! All those thai, russians

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:39.539
and 

00:04:39.539 --> 00:04:40.539
swedish

00:04:40.539 --> 00:04:42.160
people are not coming to Svalbard attracted
by the low

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:44.940
taxes, nor the coal mines. As you can imagine,
picking coal

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:49.280
in the North Pole is an expensive and not
profitable

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:54.080
business…
“Svalbard coal mine halts production”

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:57.190
And you will wonder… If coal is not profitable…
Why are

00:04:57.190 --> 00:05:00.550
there so many people coming here? Let me remind
you

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:03.740
that, during winter, Svalbard lives a never
ending night

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:07.060
where there is not even a single minute of
daylight.

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:11.050
Of course, some of those men and women work
on the

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:14.660
several science research centres existing
in the

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.330
archipielago. Actually, since 2008, Svalbard
has the Global

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:21.360
Seed Vault. An storage pit paid, mainly, by
Bill and Melinda

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:25.530
Gates Foundation and Microsoft. Here they
store a

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:27.600
collection of seeds for all the different
kind of plants that

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:31.000
exist in the world. In case of a nuclear holocaust,
mankind

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.600
would be able to replant the planet thanks
to this great

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:34.600
vault. And it´s protected against any kind
of attack.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:38.039
But this is not the reason why Svalbard is
so important. In

00:05:38.039 --> 00:05:40.669
fact, there is something more juicy than coal,
polar bears,

00:05:40.669 --> 00:05:51.520
science or Santa Claus himself…
“The Arctic holds an estimated 13% (90 billion

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:52.520
barrels) of

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:55.389
the world&amp;#39;s undiscovered conventional
oil resources and

00:05:55.389 --> 00:05:59.639
30% of its undiscovered conventional natural
gas resource”.

00:05:59.639 --> 00:06:03.780
Exactly! They have oil! But not only that!
Imagine for a

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:06.240
second that you want to ship some good from
LONDON to

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:13.479
TOKIO. Today, the fastest route would be this
one.

00:06:13.479 --> 00:06:21.090
But imagine you could do this using another
route. Do you

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:24.620
see? This is almost half of the distance.
This means less

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:27.639
spending and a faster logistics. Technology
and climate

00:06:27.639 --> 00:06:31.280
change are making possible to travel through
Arctic ocean.

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:35.259
And this would be a turning point in the international
trade.

00:06:35.259 --> 00:06:38.820
One day, this will be a reality. And that
day, Svalbard has

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:44.470
the highest chances to become the Arctic capital.
The rest

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:46.240
of the islands around belong to Russia and
are have no

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:48.530
human population. Greenland, on the other
hand, has a

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:51.240
chaotic legal system. Meanwhile, Svalbard
has a strong

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:56.039
political system and good infrastructures.
The proof is this

00:06:56.039 --> 00:06:58.259
interview to Steve, held through Skype. But
wait a minute

00:06:58.259 --> 00:07:09.541
because here it is the best part!
All this Arctic oil is under the sea. This

00:07:09.541 --> 00:07:10.541
means, the above-

00:07:10.541 --> 00:07:14.020
the-ground land of Svalbard has no oil beds,
at least that

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:17.580
we know it. All their wealth is on the so-called

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.750
CONTINENTAL SHELF. This is the underwater
landmass

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:23.320
which extends from a continent no deeper than
200m.

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:25.699
According to the international law, the continental
shelf

00:07:25.699 --> 00:07:29.069
belongs to the country it is attached to.
And, of course, it

00:07:29.069 --> 00:07:31.490
includes all the resources beneath. So it
should be the

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:33.639
government of a country the one to decide
whether if they

00:07:33.639 --> 00:07:38.759
allow companies to exploit this resources
or not.

00:07:38.759 --> 00:07:41.230
And yes, both Norway and Svalbard´s archipielago
are on

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:44.780
the same contintental shelf. Therefore, in
normal conditions,

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:47.009
Norwegian Government should have sovereignity
over this

00:07:47.009 --> 00:07:48.009
oil.

00:07:48.009 --> 00:07:49.370
BUT!!!! Do you remember what it is said on
the Svalbard

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:52.560
Treaty? Every country can exploit the resources
and

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:55.659
Norway can do nothing to stop them.

00:07:55.659 --> 00:07:58.909
The problem? Well… that treaty sais nothing
about the

00:07:58.909 --> 00:08:02.199
continental shelf or anything under the water.
At the end of

00:08:02.199 --> 00:08:04.450
the day, when it was signed, no one would
think about

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:06.530
extracting oil from the bottom of the ocean.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:10.090
And this is why, news like this one make people
so nervous.

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:14.020
“Russia believes Norway is violating the
Svalbard Treaty

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:17.080
when the Norwegian government opens three
blocks for oil

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:25.270
drilling in the Barents Sea, close to the
Arctic archipelago.”

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:28.020
In summary, Russia sais the continental shelf
of Svalbard

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:32.070
should adjust to the treaty and be exploited
by any country.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:34.979
But Norway claims that since the legal text
didn´t include

00:08:34.979 --> 00:08:37.820
anything about this, the oil and the rights
to extract it

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:45.850
belongs to them.
And… what was Russia´s answer? You might

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:46.850
still think this

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:50.279
North Pole thing is a small story. One of
those things for

00:08:50.279 --> 00:08:53.029
academics and diplomats to have discussions
while having

00:08:53.029 --> 00:08:55.610
dinner. But the truth is, Vladimir Putin sent
to his VICE

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:57.630
PRIME MINISTER, Dimitry Rogozin, to make a

00:08:57.630 --> 00:09:18.510
controversial visit to the archipielago.
But wait! The best is yet to come! This visit

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:19.510
torn Svalbard

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:22.250
into a fashionable tourism destination amont
the russians.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:25.780
In the last 2 years, the Svalbard tourism
has increased at a

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:28.360
500% rate. As I said from the beginning, there
are two

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:32.350
villages on the main island: the Norwegian
and the Russian,

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:35.000
which is called BARENTSBURG, with a population
lower

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.981
than 500 people. Well, just in the year 2015,
they had more

00:09:38.981 --> 00:09:41.690
than 60.000 tourists.

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:50.170
And 
now you might wonder Why Russian tourism is

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:51.170
that

00:09:51.170 --> 00:10:00.220
important in Svalbard? Well, it helps to retain
population.

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:09.430
For 
a better understanding, in the Russian settlement

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:10.430
there

00:10:10.430 --> 00:10:13.079
is no currency. The mining company takes care
of

00:10:13.079 --> 00:10:15.540
everything. Something like this happened on
the Norwegian

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:18.680
settlement too. But then, tourism started
and that brought

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:28.350
new kinds of business 
and different people.

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:31.230
Watch out! Here we are talking about oil and
influence in

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:33.810
what might become one of the main sea routes
in the

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:37.970
World. In fact, even China is trying to buy
properties here.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:47.860
But we will talk about this in another video.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:49.790
And now we wanna hear your opinion Do you
really think

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:54.040
Svalbard might become a new and frozen Dubai?
Shall

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:57.120
Norway let Russia exploit the Svalbard oil?
